{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20173",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.16,
      "end_seconds": 4.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.46,
      "end_seconds": 9.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.62,
      "end_seconds": 21.11,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "Um, so... a mole that has changed. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.51,
      "end_seconds": 25.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.59,
      "end_seconds": 29.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "It's been two months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.44,
      "end_seconds": 33.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.2,
      "end_seconds": 54.28,
      "duration_seconds": 19.08,
      "text": "It usually comes with a crusty edge on the mole. Mm, as for crusty edge on the mole, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.51,
      "end_seconds": 60.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "What about a mole that is itching, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.25,
      "end_seconds": 63.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Mm, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.86,
      "end_seconds": 68.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.4,
      "end_seconds": 74.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, my grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.52,
      "end_seconds": 87.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "So, any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.81,
      "end_seconds": 92.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "No, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.41,
      "end_seconds": 98.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.77,
      "end_seconds": 102.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "I take hydrocortisone cream, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.39,
      "end_seconds": 106.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.61,
      "end_seconds": 110.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "About six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.34,
      "end_seconds": 115.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.12,
      "end_seconds": 120.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Mm, no allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.47,
      "end_seconds": 130.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.65,
      "end_seconds": 133.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "I've got eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.99,
      "end_seconds": 142.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "text": "Right, so eczema is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.17,
      "end_seconds": 155.81,
      "duration_seconds": 11.64,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.72,
      "end_seconds": 165.29,
      "duration_seconds": 7.57,
      "text": "Have you had any family history of melanoma, lumps in the armpit, other new moles or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.76,
      "end_seconds": 170.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "No, um, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.65,
      "end_seconds": 176.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.48,
      "end_seconds": 180.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Actually, no, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.35,
      "end_seconds": 184.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.4,
      "end_seconds": 195.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.98,
      "end_seconds": 224.15,
      "duration_seconds": 11.17,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 109 over 69, temperature 36.6, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, respiratory rate 17, pulse is 66 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.78,
      "end_seconds": 227.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.46,
      "end_seconds": 232.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.57,
      "end_seconds": 237.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Alright, now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.99,
      "end_seconds": 251.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.95,
      "end_seconds": 254.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.64,
      "end_seconds": 277.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "I can't feel any glands in the armpit or neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.52,
      "end_seconds": 280.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.88,
      "end_seconds": 300.88,
      "duration_seconds": 9.0,
      "text": "There is a dark, six-millimetre mole with an irregular border and two shades of brown on the upper back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.25,
      "end_seconds": 321.54,
      "duration_seconds": 18.29,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Having listened and examined, this is probably a pigmented lesion that needs removal for a proper diagnosis. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. An atypical mole is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.96,
      "end_seconds": 324.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.16,
      "end_seconds": 357.82,
      "duration_seconds": 31.66,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a pigmented lesion that needs removal for a proper diagnosis, but I'd like to confirm. I'm sending you for a skin biopsy because of changing mole. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'm going to order a dermoscopy, for changing mole. Cover up and use factor 50 sunscreen on exposed skin. See me again after the biopsy results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.9,
      "end_seconds": 361.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.12,
      "end_seconds": 366.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.48,
      "end_seconds": 369.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}